    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Psychic surgery&nbsp;heals the target of all Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma damage, and it restores all points permanently drained from the target’s Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores. It also eliminates all ongoing @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.8rIj0ewW4bL8Uph5]{Confusion}, fear, and insanity effects.&nbsp;Psychic surgery&nbsp;also removes any mental afflictions that could be removed with&nbsp;dispel magic, as well as mental @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.rules.JaRMioj4isNp7r1P.JournalEntryPage.gBhZDjh30JEyh7DY]{Diseases}.&nbsp;Psychic surgery&nbsp;removes all effects magically altering the target’s memory, even instantaneous effects, and it can restore a memory to perfect clarity (even if the memory loss is due to the mundane passage of time).</p>"
    },
